00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:30.560
And instability is something where if

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.760
something starts to grow it will

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:32.720
continue to grow.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:33.519
So if you start with a little

00:10:33.519 --> 00:10:34.800
perturbation it just becomes a bigger

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.399
and bigger and bigger perturbation.

00:10:36.399 --> 00:10:37.680
And it turns out there is this thing

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.200
called the Kelvin-Helmholtz instability

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.480
which will kick in in this case. So let

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.680
me draw the same thing again

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.360
but with just the beginnings of kind of

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:46.640
an instability in the middles.

